cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "A fern identification benchmark with domain, source and geographic annotations"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data for a study of distribution shift in automated fern
  identification: 5,969 images of 152 species in 30 families from iNaturalist
  and GBIF, with per-image annotations of image domain, data source and
  country, group-aware splits by observation, 700 open-set negatives in eight
  groups, and 37 released experimental runs.
type: software
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0

